        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Find Every Number in a Sentence\n\nReturns every match of a regular expression in a text, not just the first. Use it to pull figures out of a report.\n\n**How it works:** \"Sentence\" holds a line about revenue across regions. \"Find all digits\" is a Code node that runs a global regular expression over it and returns each match as a list item. \"Matches\" shows the numbers 12, 47 and 3. It runs locally with no model or key.\n\n**Try this:** Change the \"Sentence\" value to a line with decimals such as 4.5 and adjust the pattern on \"Find all digits\" so it keeps the decimal point."
        },
        "ui_properties": {
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0
          },
          "zIndex": 0,
